WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.745
The experiments cover three regimes.

00:00:02.825 --> 00:00:08.472
First, two-dimensional synthetic densities, both
continuous and discrete,

00:00:08.552 --> 00:00:15.219
where you can literally see how well each model
captures rings and other holey shapes.

00:00:15.299 --> 00:00:21.496
Second, five standard UCI datasets: Power, Gas,
Hepmass, MiniBooNE, and BSDS300.

00:00:21.576 --> 00:00:26.910
And third, distilling sentences sampled from the
GPT2 language model.

00:00:26.990 --> 00:00:33.108
Baselines span full-covariance Gaussians,
normalizing flows like RealNVP, MADE,

00:00:33.188 --> 00:00:39.620
MAF and NSF, monotonic probabilistic circuits, and
tensor-train density estimators.
